{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/readiumlcp\/statuserror"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/ReadiumLCP"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StatusError","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For the case (revoked, returned, cancelled, expired), app should notify the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"user and stop there. The message to the user must be clear about the status"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the license: don’t display “expired” if the status is “revoked”. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"date and time corresponding to the new status should be displayed (e.g."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“The license expired on 01 January 2018”)."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If the license has been revoked, the user message should display the number","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"of devices which registered to the server. This count can be calculated","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from the number of “register” events in the status document. If no event is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"logged in the status document, no such message should appear (certainly not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“The license was registered by 0 devices”).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/ReadiumLCP\/StatusError","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Enumeration Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/ReadiumLCP\/StatusError\/canc